            <ArticleTitle>Arthritis as presenting symptom in silent adult coeliac disease. Two cases and review of the literature.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>260-3</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We report 2 cases of adult silent coeliac disease (CD) presenting with arthritis of a knee and a sacro-iliac joint, respectively. In both patients the arthritis was relieved on a gluten free diet. The literature on arthritis in adult CD is reviewed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
